    19	Every rule sat in one plain sentence near its use, sometimes with the trap explained. claude-opus-5 reads every spec in its first minute, writes its program once 3 to 10 minutes in, and never changes the graded logic afterwards. It self-tests on shipped data, on its own tiny examples, and on invariants (totals, determinism). It transliterates ANY explicit rule sentence, not only full procedures, and its self-check reproduces its own reading, so a control that reconciles only under the right reading confirms the rule for it. Known leaks: `knowledge/LEAK_LIBRARY.md`.
