    69	- (Superseded by v3.2 for parking) Kill rule (Ayush 26 Oct): park when the probe's final reward (tests and judge combined, as the harness reports it) is above 70. Tests at 100 on 2 valid runs park the task whatever the final (QL 26 Oct 18:55); otherwise tests alone never park a task: delivered peers pass with tests 85-96 and a low judge (0b27b9dc 96.5/26, 7e0d8feb 94/33, e13fd332 90/25). [v3: CONFLICTS C9, Ayush D3 26 Oct; g2/C_daaca581_DIFF.md] Variance band: above 75, park; 65 to 75, run a second probe and park when the mean final is above 70; below 65, keep. A round marked LAST is the last.
